posts.text:
Excited to see the Stop Insider Trading Act pass the House in a bipartisan vote.
 
@RepBryanSteil and I introduced this legislation to prevent Congressional insider trading and increase transparency.
 
I will work with my Senate colleagues to get the Stop Insider Trading Act passed into law.

